/-! # Jobs 5012 … 5016 of `S708` (generated by a script; core Lean, `decide +kernel`): each job's
pieces pass, are glued inside, and its first piece has the job's header `HT.entry k` -/

#e1lits B334.E1x.Pts.S708.J5012 "../data/j5012.bin"

namespace B334.E1x.Pts.S708

